    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Protean Anatomy 10",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "Il'setya's vital organs shift and change shape and position constantly. Immediately after Il'setya takes acid, electricity, or sonic damage, she gains the listed amount of resistance to that damage type. This lasts for 1 hour or until the next time she takes damage of one of the other types (in which case its resistance changes to match that type), whichever comes first.\n\nIl'setya is immune to polymorph effects unless she is a willing target. If Blinded or Deafened, Il'setya automatically recovers at the end of its next turn as new sensory organs grow to replace the compromised ones.\n\nEffect: Protean Anatomy",
